            "review_title": "Review at Yum Yum - Nasi Lemak 26 - Cơm Dừa Mã Lai",
            "review_text": "eileent3821\nKuala Lumpur, Malaysia2474 contributions\n0\nMISLEADING MENU ON GRAB APP\nFeb 2024 • Solo\nGrab delivery was ordered but the menu was very misleading!!! Nasi lemak is a dish made of rice cooked in coconut milk. Therefore when you see Nasi Lemak on the menu which we did and ordered the Nasi Lemak Chicken Drumstick we would expect to have the coconut rice and not white rice! Hence when order was received we were surprised to find that the rice was just plain steamed rice so we checked and discovered that if we wanted the coconut rice we had to add another 20,000 Vietnam dong. Therefore menu should not list it as Nasi Lemak. Very disappointing in the way they do business with misleading menu hence I would definitely not recommend this restaurant but if you do decide to order make sure you check carefully before doing so to avoid any miscommunication or disappointments!\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten March 6, 2024",
